  description: "Rustplate was once a maintenance drone coated with adaptive bio-alloy.
    When organic matter fused with its chassis during the disaster, the alloy began
    growing instead of corroding. The creature\u2019s armor continuously regenerates,
    fed by ambient metal and debris. It is a fusion of abandoned machinery and uncontrolled
    biological adaptation."
